5 Types of traffic 
1. Inbound Traffic 
◆ Data coming into AWS from the internet or users. 
Examples: 
• A user opening your website hosted on EC2 
• Uploading a file to S3 
• API calls from clients to your application 
2. Outbound Traffic 
◆ Data going out of AWS to the internet. 
Examples: 
• Sending website content to users 
• Downloading files from S3 
• API responses to clients 
