9 What are the purchasing option In AWS 
1. On-Demand Instances= Pay only for the hours/seconds you use. 
No long-term commitment. 
2. Saving plans = 1 year or 3 year only 
3. Reserve Instance = Reserve Avablity zones/ region/ store instance type. 
4. Spot Instance = Buy unused AWS capacity at a very LOW price (up to 90% cheaper). 
But AWS can stop them anytime. 
5. Capacity Reservation = Reserve capacity in avaiblity zones. 
6. Dedicated instance and Dedicated Hoste= You get your own physical server (not 
shared with anyone). 
